# Fetched external payloads — Agmarknet prices, Open-Meteo weather, ERA5 hazard
# climatology. **Committed on purpose** (14.7 MB): NFR-303 requires the demo to run with the
# network disabled, and a fixture bundle that only exists on the machine that fetched it is
# not a fixture bundle. `git clone && make seed` has to work on a train.
#
# Re-fetching is possible but not required: seed/fetch_agmarknet.py, fetch_weather.py and
# fetch_climatology.py all write here, and the Agmarknet endpoint is undocumented and may
# stop working — which is precisely why the responses are kept rather than the ability to
# ask for them again.

